# Normalise text to LF in the repository, whatever the checkout platform does.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touch data files. Earlier in this project, autocrlf rewriting two ligation-matrix
# CSVs once broke their SHA-256 integrity checks in a related project -- the same class
# of failure would silently corrupt any checksum or byte-comparison we run against these.
*.xlsx  binary
*.npz   binary
*.gb    binary
data/**   -text
results/** -text

# Notebooks are JSON; keep them diffable but never line-ending-converted.
*.ipynb -text
